  "id": "circadian-rhythm",
  "term": "circadian rhythm",
  "definition": "A circadian rhythm is the body’s biological pattern that follows the daily light–dark cycle. When this timing is disrupted, such as by constant light or modern lighting conditions, melatonin levels can change and functions such as balance may be affected.",
